  m_Name: FoolCard
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Card
  Name: The Fool
  text: "The card dances in your hand, light and unpredictable, yet full of hidden
    purpose.  $It laughs at rules and mocks the rigid order of the world, daring
    to step where others fear.  $You feel the Fools\u2019s spirit within it\u2014mischievous,
    clever, and unbound, yet driven by a fire that burns for change.  $Behind the
    laughter and the tricks, a plan takes shape: the people\u2019s anger, the kingdom\u2019s
    rot, and the spark of revolution waiting to ignite.  $The Fool reminds you that
    even chaos can have a purpose, and that the smallest spark can bring down the
    mightiest walls."
  sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: aabccfaf4f8a5da4f985a7378645cf71, type: 3}
